## Installation

Clone the repository:

    git clone https://github.com/roudyd33/langchain-rag-architecture.git
    cd langchain-rag-architecture

Install dependencies:

    pip install -r requirements.txt

Install and start Ollama:
https://ollama.com/

Download the required models:

    ollama pull nomic-embed-text
    ollama pull qwen2.5:3b

Run the application:

    streamlit run app.py

## Requirements

Ollama must be installed and running locally with both required models available.

